<description>&lt;p&gt;Syrian authorities continue to integrate thousands of foreign fighters while the Islamic State threat persists, complicating security efforts. A Syrian farmer was killed by a landmine remnant in Idlib, and two Syrian security officers were killed and four wounded in a raid near Damascus. The Syrian interior minister discussed cooperation with Interpol on cross-border crime. The conflict produced 2,732 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxPd0k4MkFvZUNzUmQ3SFlLTC1wU3JtU1FpWWl0a0V1RDVwRjJ1b2I2Yl9JT1lxclhPOEJ0QnBLTDJrY013T3REUDNtd1FxRlhjMFp3alJlNV9aVHo2T2Q0U1ljRHVMOVdKWHdpb05LU3pqVk1IeUxGeFJrNG5ZaVJIQ2E0Um00RWZNWl9TemVxSzgtWjcyb1Z5VWZ6T3pHcENnZ2t5TlI0XzF0T1JOc3RFRTU3dk9TdlEz0gG-AUFVX3lxTE82MEhKTi1BUVBaaG9NRkFHeGdoYk9ObDFzaDkxclhWZ0QyaHZIY3NkVjJkMEVwUUtQci1KUjRYTjkydjBQTV9LYlRmcXdnZEVqSnowMVg3NjFPUkloLVRtMzRjZEFOVlhCUmJvTXBDWU5XcGtBMEtHR2xRbG44OXZZdWlGdkF3d0YxZlFQLWUyTnBTalJzc1FwUVEzQXp1OVNJbWtMOXJLVnNheDdvcUdReUhNakxiOVJlN201UFE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE9ydE5xZ1g5SV9vbnY4dzc1bmxkSWVEUFBTdWFZRkN1RUhFWXJUUENIb09OYnpYc0dOOVFlMGpQMEg0YzV4bVdPNg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Haaretz&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxOLVlGU2ZyNWZaS3dmLWtiNEpHSTJNLXJrN05sY1RIRDVYNlhQMGw3UE00djBGcDVZYld6TDZ2WWREVTRkbzVQTVdiekw4Skl3NGhfaV80ZHlNdkxWbHB5VUR4WGZDV2xfTGRpWTVNT1g1eWozZllPYWZMTGJySGp6Q3d5UEJVN08tampzdHF4Q3g5alotakZQZElyZDltci1MU1NhVEwxV3NNLTJUY3RqV0tzOA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Arise News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://new